    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00989_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Dodge and fall back, we'll retreat and call in reinforcements! I hate to admit it, but we got piss poor compatibility against this Cancer!",
